Disclaimer

This repository is an independent portfolio/demo project created to demonstrate AI engineering concepts for industrial operations.

The equipment, incidents, SOPs, maintenance records, and operational data used by the application are simulated examples. The project does not contain or represent confidential operational data, proprietary procedures, or production systems belonging to Shell or any other LNG operator.

